export anchor RolodexStyle:
    number: 341
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Rolodex
    idea: The pipeline as a rotary card file on a dark desk, each deal a typed index card with a coloured stage tab, cards filed back to front so their top strips stay readable, and one card pulled forward open in full.
    base: dark
    palette:
        desk: #141110, the page and the style sheet
        cardStock: #2a2520, filed cards, summary and notes cards, secondary buttons
        frontCard: #352e27, the pulled card
        rule: #4f443a, card edges and dashed rules
        ink: #efe4d0, typed text
        pencil: #c2b298, labels and owners
        dark: #1e1914, text on every tab and on the primary button
        slateTab: #b9c7d8, Lead
        sageTab: #a9d1b0, Qualified
        manilaTab: #e8c27a, Proposal, the primary button, target bar and focus
        salmonTab: #e6a58f, Negotiation
        oliveTab: #cfe08a, Won and Closed
        stampRed: #ff9c86, the Stalled stamp and triangle
    type:
        A typewriter stack, American Typewriter, Courier Prime, Courier New,
        Courier, with tabs in Avenir Next Condensed, Arial Narrow, Roboto
        Condensed. Base 15px. The title and open card name are 24px at 700,
        values 15px at 700, tabs and divider labels 12px condensed uppercase
        at 700 tracked .12em, meta 13px.
    layout:
        A header with Brightwork Sales in tracked caps, the title Deal card
        file Q4, Find card and a manila New card button, over a dashed rule.
        Three columns follow. A 170px rail of stage dividers shows coloured
        tabs with name and count, Proposal pulled out 10px with a shadow.
        The centre is the drum, two dark rails on its sides, a stack of six
        filed cards and a twin knob drawing below. Cards run back to front
        from Lumen Bakery to Bluewater Clinics, each 14px narrower than the
        card in front, with a stage tab at a stage specific position along
        the top, so every card shows its name, value, owner and status on
        one strip. The front card, Saltwater Freight, is open in full with
        Pulled for follow up, the value, a dotted fact list and a tilted
        double ruled red Stalled stamp. A 300px side column holds a
        Quarter summary card with dotted lines and a manila target bar,
        and a Notes card with the activity. Below 1050px the rail becomes a
        row of top tabs and the side cards sit under the drum.
    spacing: An 8px unit. Cards overlap by 4px and step in 14px per card, 28px between rail, drum and side cards.
    density: Medium. Six filed cards show one strip each and one card is open in full.
    corners: 4px cards with a square corner under the tab, 6px tab tops, 8px divider tabs.
    borders: 1px rule on every card, a 3px top edge in the stage colour, a red rule under side card heads, dotted rules under typed lines, a double ruled stamp.
    shadows: Cards cast a short shadow up onto the card behind, the pulled card casts a deep 10px 24px shadow.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.9 stroke inline with typed text. Stalled is a
        tilted red stamp with a triangle and the word.
    focus: A 3px manila outline offset 3px.
    tone: Office file words, such as Deal card file, Find card, New card and Pulled for follow up.
